{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ大阪公演ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみー。\n久しぶりのライブで久しぶりのツアーなのでわくわくどきどきしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は1stツアーとは違って色んな演出が盛り込まれているので、ぜひ楽しみにしていてほしいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せ忘れていた #ゆみこかめら 載せます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH32YH3X3AG1M0CYKVASYQS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛く並んでいたさんぴん茶たち。\n思わず撮ってしまいました。\nこういうのすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH32ZG3648WA1H9CT8ME4A5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH330FZAKDKVMQSQMAYBTJZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH331E6DYSRSV3S2CHMZXKK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH332FMYCEMGJV0G9BVX8D6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH333E7TM8C44Z26GQ9CG5N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上のこういう表情好きで、よく写真撮る時にやってもらいます☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH334CAS15T7BB3TWDDXY4Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天の目好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、皆さんはお家の中でここだけはきれいじゃないと落ち着かない！みたいなところありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はね、クローゼットなんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服のためにもきれいにしておくのが好きなんです。\n少し前に衣替えも含めてお掃除しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋服冬服も可愛いからね。\nお洋服のお家もきれいにしておかないと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ネットで買ったシャツとニットが大当たりで嬉しかったです☺︎\nでもシャツは半袖っぽかったので慌てて昨日着ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつ寒くなっていってますからね。\n体調の変化にはお気をつけください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH335MCA58G0CE13SKXDP8J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH336MXHVP88YTKWDR7Y46W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、皆さんライブでお会いしましょう☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、今日はここまでです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関有美子🐱"}],"source":"archive"}